    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Baller is a multiplayer Game in which you knock players off the platform to score points. It has five Game modes: Sky Battle, Core Defense, TowerBall, Free for All, and Dodgeball(including Classic dodgeball).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Battle(2-4 Teams), where the player has to build their way to Enemy Core and destroy it.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Defense is Defending the Core From the Enemy Team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652390/extras/a7cb9fc55e88d1c96f22b73e2a18bfec.avif?t=1754482407\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Core)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodgeball and Towerball, where the player has to knock enemy players off the platform to score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free for All and Classic Dodgeball, eliminate enemy players until the last player or team Standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 70 special dodgeballs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >39 Dodgeball maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 Sky Battle(2-4 Teams) maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Towerball maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
